","_flex_align_self":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"561ef2e","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://xtremestpete.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/CoupleRetreat-scaled.jpg","id":3108,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"image_size":"medium_large"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"},{"id":"897bc82","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h2 data-start="289" data-end="334">Ride the Best Jet Ski Rentals in Tampa Bay</h2><p data-start="336" data-end="572">Looking for jet ski rentals in Tampa Bay? Xtreme Jetski Watersports is located in St Petersburg, FL and proudly serves riders from across the Tampa Bay area — including Tampa, Clearwater, St Pete Beach, and surrounding Gulf communities.</p><p data-start="574" data-end="738">Just a short drive over the bridge, you’ll launch directly into open Gulf waters with access to Egmont Key, Shell Key, and some of the clearest water in the region.</p><p data-start="740" data-end="841">If you’re searching for jet ski rentals near Tampa, this is where locals and visitors choose to ride.</p><hr data-start="843" data-end="846" /><h2 data-start="848" data-end="885">Why Tampa Bay Riders Choose Xtreme</h2><p data-start="887" data-end="1113">✔ Brand New Yamaha WaveRunners with Bluetooth Audio<br data-start="938" data-end="941" />✔ Launch Directly into Open Gulf Waters<br data-start="980" data-end="983" />✔ Crystal Clear Water &amp; Island Destinations<br data-start="1026" data-end="1029" />✔ 5.0 Rated by 365+ Riders on Google<br data-start="1065" data-end="1068" />✔ No Hidden Fees<br data-start="1084" data-end="1087" />✔ Instant Online Booking</p><p data-start="1115" data-end="1286">Unlike congested downtown launch points, our location gives Tampa Bay riders faster access to open water, dolphins, and scenic island riding without marina traffic delays.</p><hr data-start="1288" data-end="1291" /><h2 data-start="1293" data-end="1336">Just Minutes from Tampa – Worth the Ride</h2><p data-start="1338" data-end="1385">Many of our customers drive from Tampa because:</p><p data-start="1387" data-end="1572">• You get true Gulf access, not just bay cruising<br data-start="1436" data-end="1439" />• You avoid no-wake zones and river traffic<br data-start="1482" data-end="1485" />• You can ride to Egmont Key<br data-start="1513" data-end="1516" />• You get premium, fully loaded skis — not base models</p><p data-start="1574" data-end="1659">We are easily accessible from Tampa via the Howard Frankland Bridge and Gandy Bridge.</p><p data-start="1661" data-end="1727">The short drive gives you a dramatically better riding experience.</p><hr data-start="1729" data-end="1732" /><h2 data-start="1734" data-end="1779">Explore the Best Riding Areas in Tampa Bay</h2><p data-start="1781" data-end="1820">When you rent with us, you can explore:</p><h3 data-start="1822" data-end="1836">Egmont Key</h3><p data-start="1837" data-end="1907">Crystal clear water, historic lighthouse views, and dolphin sightings.</p><h3 data-start="1909" data-end="1922">Shell Key</h3><p data-start="1923" data-end="1985">A hidden island paradise perfect for sandbar stops and photos.</p><h3 data-start="1987" data-end="2007">Open Gulf Waters</h3><p data-start="2008" data-end="2066">Wide open throttle, smooth riding, and unbeatable scenery.</p><p data-start="2068" data-end="2168">This is why riders searching for jet ski rentals Tampa Bay end up choosing our St Petersburg launch.</p><hr data-start="2170" data-end="2173" /><h2 data-start="2175" data-end="2190">Who We Serve</h2><p data-start="2192" data-end="2225">We regularly welcome riders from:</p><p data-start="2227" data-end="2339">• Tampa<br data-start="2234" data-end="2237" />• South Tampa<br data-start="2250" data-end="2253" />• Clearwater<br data-start="2265" data-end="2268" />• Brandon<br data-start="2277" data-end="2280" />• Riverview<br data-start="2291" data-end="2294" />• Wesley Chapel<br data-start="2309" data-end="2312" />• Largo<br data-start="2319" data-end="2322" />• St Pete Beach</p><p data-start="2341" data-end="2432">If you're anywhere in the Tampa Bay region, we are your premium jet ski rental destination.</p><hr data-start="2434" data-end="2437" /><h2 data-start="2439" data-end="2482">Jet Ski Rental Requirements in Tampa Bay</h2><p data-start="2484" data-end="2513">Before booking, keep in mind:</p><p data-start="2515" data-end="2670">• Operators must be 16+<br data-start="2538" data-end="2541" />• Renters must be 18+<br data-start="2562" data-end="2565" />• Anyone born after Jan 1, 1988 must complete a Florida boating safety test<br data-start="2640" data-end="2643" />• Valid photo ID required</p><p data-start="2672" data-end="2747">You can complete the temporary boating certificate online before your ride.</p><hr data-start="2749" data-end="2752" /><h2 data-start="2754" data-end="2781">Ready to Ride Tampa Bay?</h2><p data-start="2783" data-end="2885">If you're searching for jet ski rentals Tampa Bay, book your ride today and experience the difference.</p><p data-start="2887" data-end="3016">Our brand new Yamaha WaveRunners, open Gulf access, and 5-star safety record make us the top choice for riders across the region.</p><p data-start="3018" data-end="3066"> </p>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"2","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"text_color":"#FFFFFF","__globals__":{"text_color":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"87de3bc","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://xtremestpete.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/YoungCoupleEgmont-scaled.jpg","id":3110,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"image_size":"medium_large"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"},{"id":"5367b4d","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://xtremestpete.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/CoupleEgmont-scaled.jpg","id":3111,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"image_size":"medium_large"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"}],"isInner":false}]
